    {
      "id": 116037,
      "name": "Pydro",
      "username": "Pydro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-22T22:37:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Every time there is a rule you don't like, you just house rule it. Maybe you should play with the real rules, after all, those will be the rules for official tournaments. Besides, if you played with your rule, Tactics just turns into a drinking game...</p><p>Wait.........</p><p>..............</p><p>Hole on a sec..........</p><p>That's not a bad idea. How about this. Every time one of your characters in incapped, you have to drink something from the country of the character that incaps you. No that won't work, I would just try to incap myslef every time. So, how about this. Every time you incap someone, you get to take a drink from the country of the character that you incapped. Now that could work. Any chance we can get another official ruling on this?</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:48:22.297Z",
