      "created_at": "2014-08-23T13:24:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Each Health token on a character is replaced with a filled shot glass. When that hero loses health, you slam a shot. When the hero gets up, you refill all the shot glasses.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
